        "text_ab_dek": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Nothing you could print on a swing tag: a hundred small decisions made the same way every time. The hide chosen for the piece rather than the price. The stitch that holds without glue behind it. The hour spent on an edge most people will never look at. Underneath them we kept finding the same three things.</p>",
